# Line endings (D-027).
# Every text file is stored in git with LF, whatever the OS that edits it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, fingerprinted outputs are stored byte-for-byte: NO conversion.
# Their SHA-256 values in the test lock were computed over the exact bytes written
# on the dev laptop (CRLF). Converting them on commit would change those bytes, and
# every fresh clone (CI, Docker builds) would then fail the model check (D-020, D-023).
models/** -text
reports/** -text

# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers: CRLF would break them ("/bin/sh^M").
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
